[size=4][b][color=#FFB833]✦ Installation[/color][/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Download [b]AITraffic-v0.2.8.zip[/b].
[*]Drag and drop into Unity Mod Manager, or extract into [i]Derail Valley/Mods/[/i].
[*]Verify that AI Traffic, DVSignals, and CommsRadioAPI show green status indicators in UMM ([i]Ctrl + F10[/i]).
[/list]
